    "summary": "Heap buffer overflow in parse_header",
    "description": "### Summary\n\n`parse_header` in tinyparse.c copies up to 255 bytes into a 16 byte heap buffer.\n\n### Reproducer for reprobot\n\n```reprobot\nversion: 1\nproject: tinyparse\ncommit: COMMIT\nprofile: asan\nrun:\n  cmd: [\"bin/tinyparse\", \"poc/input.bin\"]\n  timeout_seconds: 20\n  repeat: 3\nfiles:\n  - input.bin\nclaim:\n  sanitizer: address\n  kind: heap-buffer-overflow\n  frame: parse_header\n  text: |\n    The memcpy in parse_header in tinyparse.c copies up to 255 bytes into a\n    16 byte heap buffer.\n```\n\n```reprobot-file input.bin\nINPUT\n```\n\n### Impact\n\nHeap buffer overflow when parsing an untrusted file.\n",
